# Screen Style And I18n Rules

- Every screen must follow the `index.tsx` pattern:
  - text from `useI18n()` (`t("...")`), no hardcoded user-facing strings
  - colors from `useAppTheme()`, no hardcoded color literals
  - styles generated by `createStyles(colors)` and memoized with `useMemo`
- Keep style keys semantic (`container`, `card`, `title`, `subtitle`) and consistent across screens.
- Font families must come from `fonts.*` and sizes from `fontSize.size*` or `fontScale(...)`.
- New screens should keep the same clean flow: imports -> hooks -> memoized styles -> JSX.

## Baseline Pattern

```tsx
const { t } = useI18n();
const { colors } = useAppTheme();
const styles = useMemo(() => createStyles(colors), [colors]);
```
